01:10:43.480 --> 01:10:46.483
♪ [music]


01:11:24.866 --> 01:11:30.078
♪ [suspenseful]


01:11:30.113 --> 01:11:31.425
Wake up!


01:11:31.459 --> 01:11:35.291
Wake up!
Wake up!


01:11:35.325 --> 01:11:37.845
You gotta wake up!
You gotta wake up!


01:11:37.879 --> 01:11:43.333
♪ [suspenseful]


01:11:43.368 --> 01:11:44.921
