01:13:46.491 --> 01:13:49.321
Oh, weird question.


01:13:49.355 --> 01:13:54.602
Can I sleep on
your couch tonight?


01:13:54.637 --> 01:13:57.122
Of course.


01:13:57.156 --> 01:14:00.539
